					"id": 718050701,
					"content": "关于那两本书…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718050702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纪芳"
				},
				{
					"id": 718050702,
					"content": "这两位是老客人了，他们订的书我一般都会早点准备。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718050703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纪芳"
				},
				{
					"id": 718050703,
					"content": "但突然来了那么多客人，我一下子应付不过来，把这两本书拖了这么久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718050704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纪芳"
				},
				{
					"id": 718050704,
					"content": "他们一定都等得不耐烦了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "纪芳"
				}
			]
